  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nA more photographic and aesthetic tone — use this recipe for portraits under a clear sky to capture the soft, dreamy atmosphere of spring. The colors convey a subtle sense of an unfamiliar yet beautiful melancholy. Spring is often known as the season of new beginnings, yet it has always felt slightly unfamiliar to me — filled with an awkward air, fresh starts, and a quiet uncertainty about the future. This Nikon Imaging Recipe expresses the vivid colors of spring within a gentle, melancholic mood, capturing the emotional temperature of the season.",
